cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SiPM multiplexing in a monolithic PET detector - a teaching re-implementation"
message: >-
  This repository is an independent educational re-implementation and contains no new
  scientific findings. Please cite the source article (listed under 'preferred-citation'),
  not this software alone. Cite the software as well only if the implementation itself is
  what you are referring to.
